    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know. \"defiance\" just sounds like more work. if nothing actually has value, then isn't it just math? like, if everything is zero, then adding one more day of pain doesn't really change the sum. it's just zero plus zero. it feels more logical to just stop the equation entirely.",
